  "product_info": {
    "title": "Sony PlayStation 4 1TB Console With Controller",
    "description": "The <strong>Sony PlayStation 4 1TB (Jet Black)</strong> delivers the ultimate home entertainment experience, combining incredible gameplay, HD movies, and music in one powerful console. With <b>8GB GDDR5 RAM</b> and a <b>1TB storage capacity</b>, it’s designed to handle your favorite blockbuster titles, streaming apps, and downloads effortlessly. <br><br> Enjoy smoother gameplay and richer visuals on HDR-supported TVs, while the <b>DualShock 4 wireless controller</b> enhances precision and immersion with its responsive triggers, touchpad, and lightbar. Connect easily via <b>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 4.0, and USB 3.1 ports</b>, and access an entire universe of entertainment through the <b>PlayStation Store</b>. Whether you’re gaming solo, streaming movies, or connecting with friends online, the PS4 keeps you entertained from start to finish.",
